# PredMaCC - LLM Configuration
# When running on Snowflake SiS, Cortex AI_COMPLETE is used automatically (no config needed).
# For local development, configure one of the options below:

# Option 1: Snowflake Cortex (via Snowpark session — requires snowflake-snowpark-python)
# The app auto-detects an active Snowpark session and uses SNOWFLAKE.CORTEX.COMPLETE()

# Option 2: External LLM providers (uncomment and fill in)
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-20250514

# Option 3: Azure OpenAI
# AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY=
# AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT=https://your-resource.openai.azure.com/
# AZURE_OPENAI_DEPLOYMENT=gpt-4o

# Cortex model to use (when running on Snowflake)
CORTEX_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6
